  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Sword Strike" id="75b0-031d-75c7-05ce" hidden="false">
      <description>Castellan Crowe gains the &quot;Smash&quot; rule.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Blade Shield" id="bc8e-cea1-4de6-fc85" hidden="false">
      <description>Castallen Crowe may re-roll all failed saving throws.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="GREY KNIGHTS" id="6158-067d-3fd1-b234" hidden="false">
      <description>The Grey Knights Gene-seed comes from the Emperor himself and confers the following benefits to all models with Firstborn Astartes (Grey Knights)
Purity of Spirit
The Aegis
Preferred Enemy: Daemons</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Soul Imprint" id="bc89-d3d8-3a43-35e5" hidden="false">
      <description>A character wielding the Soul Glaive re-rolls failed psychic tests when attempting to manifest Force.
If this attempt is succesfully manifested on this character, or his unit, then the Soul Glaive rerolls all failed to hit, to wound and armour penetration-rolls while the Blessing is in effect.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Master Swordsman" id="f7cf-e67d-b8b6-7d5b" hidden="false" page="63" publicationId="3ff9-2058-b559-545b">
      <description>Whenever Castellan Crow fights in a challenge, he uses both the Sword Strike and Blade Shield Stance.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="The Perfect Warrior" id="8fcb-960b-8060-eb13" hidden="false">
      <description>Castellan Crowe must always issue and accept challenges when able. When in an assault, Castallan must pick either the Sword Strike or Blade Shield stance to fight in until the end of the Assault phase.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Power of the Machine-Spirit" id="c6e7-c642-a94f-39fd" hidden="false">
      <description>A Vehicle with this special rule may attack different targets with each Ranged weapon it is permitted to fire during any Shooting Attack.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Psychic Pilot" id="94a3-b676-040c-9bee" hidden="false" page="0">
      <description>A vehicle with this special rule is a Psyker. The vehicle is considered to have a Leadership characteristic of 10, should this be needed in order to resolve any psychic power.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Force Shielding" id="39c6-4bbe-7a66-46f6" hidden="false">
      <description>Models with Force Shielding have an Invulnurable Save of 5+</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Brotherhood of Psykers" id="b014-94f5-3313-9448" hidden="false">
      <description>A unit with this rule is considered to be a single psyker and gains the Sanctic psychic discipline. These units may choose to cast a Psychic power as described in the Santic Discipline rules.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Purifying Flame" id="f920-c68a-30fa-b509" hidden="false">
      <description>All close combat attacks made by Purifiers have the Soul Blaze special rule.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
