              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">Any unit charging into close combat on the same turn as it disembarks from the vehicle counts as having Psyk-Out Grenades. If the unit targeted by these grenades is hit and contains any Daemons or Psykers, these are reduced to Initiative 1 for the remainder of the phase.</characteristic>
