              <profiles>
                <profile name="Rear Grapples" id="4821-6877-fb11-9364" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">A Vortimer Pattern Landraider may choose to Transport another vehicle or Dreadnought with its rear grapples. Dreadnoughts are transported and may disembark as normal and cost no additional transport capacity.
If a vehicle is transported in this way, it must remain in base to base contact with the rear armour of the Vortimer Pattern Landraider for the duration of transportation.
If the Vortimer Pattern Landraider is destroyed, the transported vehicle or Dreadnought suffers a Strength 10 hit, for vehicles, this is assumed to hit the front armour.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
