          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">Silver tipped, psychically charged ammunition made specifically to destroy daemons. Once fired, these bolts glow with a blue light, striking with significantly greater force than an orginary bolter round.


A Storm Bolter, Hurricane Bolter, Heavy Bolter or Assault Cannon armed with Psybolt Ammunition gains +1 to it&apos;s Strength value.</characteristic>
